  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helping Indigenous Communities Protect their Lands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frayba accompanies the indigenous communities in Chiapas in their struggle to defend the rights to autonomy, their land and territory. Facing corporate threats, militarization, dispossession and the interests of organized crime, the communities organize themselves to carry out a comprehensive and collective struggle to defend their lands, their lives and their human rights. Together, we defend the communities, their autonomy and Mother Earth.</narrative>
  </description>
